  id: Desert_Campfire_2
  headerName: Heat and Cold
  content: "\tYou might think the only enemy here is the heat. You'd be wrong. The
    nights become something entirely different. The cold they carry is ferocious.
    You will need something to keep you warm. Prepare before the sun goes down. I
    hope you're reading this while there's still light."
